  "notes": "Franklin County Republicans elect 2 committeepersons per precinct ('REP COMMITTEEPERSON <precinct>', vote for 2) in all 73 precincts at the 2026 primary; seats are labelled Committeeperson 1-2. Seat status is from the county's results vendor page for the 2026 May Primary, last updated 6/4/2026; the page does not say whether the figures are certified. filled = a ballot candidate with votes; unknown = no ballot candidate for the seat but write-in votes were cast (the page reports write-ins only as a total, so named write-in winners can't be identified and stay unknown); empty = no ballot candidate and no write-in votes. The county's 2026 primary Write-In Report PDF was overwritten by the November general and no 2026 folder exists yet in its Past Election Results archive. Appointments since the primary are not captured."
}
